The Software Engineer 3, AI Builder Experience role at MongoDB aligns directl=
y with my background in building MCP tooling and orchestrating autonomous age=
ntic workflows in Python. At Black Piano, I developed a custom MCP tool for n=
on-technical teams backed by automated pipelines and engineered a self-healin=
g data-quality agent with retry logic and human-in-the-loop escalation. Indep=
endently, I built MyLocalCLI, an open-source terminal coding assistant on npm=
 featuring a Stdio MCP bridge and parallel tool execution, alongside Python-b=
ased multi-agent orchestration systems like JobAgents.

